# ─── ACT-R access logs (runtime, auto-generated) ──────────
# 政策：所有 atom 遙測 sidecar（read_hits/confirmations/usefulness）一律不進版控——
# per-machine 執行期資料，提交會 churn + 跨機衝突。下方 blanket 收斂全部位置
# （含 _AIDocs/_atoms/ local realm、_AIDocs/Tools/；2026-06 補 S1/S2 realm 遷移破口）。
**/*.access.json
memory/*.access.json
memory/**/*.access.json
**/memory/*.access.json
**/memory/**/*.access.json
_AIDocs/Failures/*.access.json

# ─── Staging area (temp files, session prompts) ──────────
memory/_staging/

# ─── Auto-capture drafts (隔離區，未確認 [臨]，不入版控/索引/注入) ─────────
memory/_drafts/
**/memory/shared/_drafts/

# ─── Episodic atoms (TTL 24d, auto-generated) ─────────────
memory/episodic/

# ─── Distant memory archive (expired atoms) ───────────────
memory/_distant/

# ─── User-specific config (per-user, auto-generated) ──────
# IDENTITY.md / USER.md 為個人實例（從 IDENTITY.template / USER.template 拷出）；模板 tracked, 實例 ignored
USER.md
USER-*.md
!prompts/user-decision-*.md
IDENTITY.md
IDENTITY-*.md

# ─── User-specific atoms (hardware, local env) ────────────
memory/hardware.md

# ─── Session transcripts (huge, not needed in repo) ───────
projects/*/*.jsonl
projects/*/*/

# ─── Nested .claude (auto-generated by Claude Code) ───────
.claude/

# ─── Node.js runtimes (portable, not tracked) ────────────
tools/node22/

# ─── Vector DB eval/audit logs (local diagnostics) ──────
memory/_vectordb/audit.log
memory/_vectordb/eval-results-*.json

# ─── Playwright MCP (browser automation cache) ──────────
.playwright-mcp/

# ─── Dashboard screenshots (local artifacts) ────────────
dashboard-*.png
world-*.png

